List the current user's customers.

Query parameters:

page (int, default 1)

per_page (int, default 20, max 100)

q (string) — case-insensitive search on name, email, company

Response:

json
{
  "items": [ { "id": 1, "name": "...", "email": "...", "...": "..." } ],
  "total": 42,
  "page": 1,
  "per_page": 20,
  "pages": 3
}
